# U-Boot environment, layout v3 (doku/109-plan-layout-v3.md, section 2.1, table):
# partition hy310-env from LBA 14336, the environment itself 128 sectors =
# byte offset 0x700000 (7 MiB), size 0x10000 (64 KiB) = CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET /
# CONFIG_ENV_SIZE in hy310_qz713_v3_1_defconfig. One copy (doku/109 section 7).
#
# Until 12.09.2026 this said 0x500000 (LBA 10240) - that lay inside the U-Boot
# window (hy310-uboot, 2048..12287), where U-Boot never reads. fw_setenv would
# have written into the void, and the acceptance check in build-rootfs.sh had
# hard-coded the wrong value. Noticed when the env was empty after flashing
# v0.8 and Marco asked how that could be.
#
# Format: <device> <offset> <size>

/dev/mmcblk0	0x700000	0x10000
